%decision OfficialRosterFromJSONWalksHashMap
  what:    FromJSON OfficialRoster manually walks the officialPlayers HashMap via HM.elems
  why:     Source JSON nests players under an object keyed by player id, not under a JSON array. dataPulled and checksum are required (.: not .:?), unlike Input.ActiveRoster which makes them optional. OfficialPlayer instance uses RecordWildCards in its return so all 9 fields are bound by name during parse.
